<% content_for :title, "API documentation · tinyslug" %>
<article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-16">
  <p class="text-sm font-medium text-lime-300">API v1</p><h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Create a short link</h1><p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate-300">Send a bearer token created in Settings. A newly created link returns <code>201</code>; an unnamed matching link returns <code>200</code>.</p>
  <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold">POST /api/v1/links</h2>
  <pre class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black/30 p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-200"><code>curl --request POST <%= Rails.configuration.x.app_protocol %>://<%= Rails.configuration.x.app_host %>/api/v1/links \
  --header 'Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN' \
  --header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  --data '{
    "link": {
      "destination_url": "https://example.com/article",
      "name": "Example article",
      "slug": "example-article",
      "tracking_enabled": true,
      "tags": ["docs", "example"]
    }
  }'</code></pre>
  <p class="mt-6 text-slate-400">Validation errors return <code>422</code>. Missing, malformed, unknown, and revoked bearer tokens return <code>401</code>.</p>
</article>
